## BungeeGuard (proxy-side) example config
## - Install the BungeeGuard plugin jar in `Server/proxy/plugins/`
## - Copy this file to `config.yml` and set a strong secret
##
## IMPORTANT: This secret must match the backend-side BungeeGuard config(s).

allowed-tokens:
  - "CHANGE_ME__GENERATE_A_LONG_RANDOM_TOKEN"

